        "width": 708,
        "height": 508
      },
      "text": [
        "ಅವೆರಡೂ ದಿನ ಆಟ ಆಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು."
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "image": {
        "src": "/data/picturebooks/586327-aame-matthu-molada-gelethana/p09.jpg",
